  "description": {
   "en": "I believed it was destiny that brought us together. It's my irreplaceable home, warm like spring sunshine. Therefore…\nHere is the newly depicted story of the lost girls from the TV anime *BanG Dream! It's MyGO!!!!!*. (Comic Growl)",
   "id": "Aku percaya takdirlah yang akan mempertemukan kita. Inilah rumahku yang tak tergantikan, rasanya hangat seperti sinar mentari di musim semi.\n\nIni adalah kisah tentang gadis-gadis yang tersesat dari anime televisi \"BanG Dream! It's MyGO!!!!!\".\n\n(dari Comic Growl)"
  },
